hadiths[115]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3450","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Isa Ibn Maryam ne aik aadmi ko chori karte dekha aur us se kaha: Kiya tum ne chori ki? Us ne kaha: Hargiz nahi, us zaat ki qasam jis ke siwa koi mabood nahi; to Isa ne kaha: Main Allah par iman laya aur apni aankh ko jhutlaya."
"3451","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri walida ne dekha goya un se noor nikla jis se Shaam ke mahal roshan ho gaye."
"3452","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kufr ka sar mashriq ki taraf hai; aur fakhr aur takabbur ghoron, oonton aur kashtkaron, oon walon mein hai; aur sukoon bakriyon walon mein hai."
"3453","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kufr ka sar yahan hai jahan se shaitan ka seeng nikalta hai, yaani mashriq."
"3454","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Safon ko mila kar rakho; kyunke shaitan khaali jagah mein khara hota hai."
"3455","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni safon ko mila kar rakho, un ke darmiyan faasla kam karo aur gardanein barabar rakho."
"3456","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ka khwab nabuwat ke chaalees hisson mein se aik hissa hai; aur wo parinde ke pair par hai jab tak us se baat na ki jaye; phir jab us se baat ki jaye to gir jata hai; aur us se baat na karo magar aqalmand ya dost se."
"3457","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ka khwab nabuwat ke chhiyalees hisson mein se aik hissa hai."
"3458","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ka khwab nabuwat ke chhiyalees hisson mein se aik hissa hai; aur wo parinde ke pair par hai jab tak us se baat na ki jaye; aur jab us se baat ki jaye to waaqe ho jata hai."
"3459","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Naik musalman ka khwab nabuwat ke sattar hisson mein se aik hissa hai."
"3460","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine meraj ki raat Ibrahim ko dekha to unhon ne kaha: Ae Muhammad, apni ummat ko salam pahunchao aur unhein khabar do ke jannat ki mitti paakeeza aur paani meetha hai; aur wo khaali maidan hai aur us ki kheti ye hai: Subhanallah, Alhamdulillah, La ilaha illallah, Allahu Akbar, wa la haula wa la quwwata illa billah."
"3461","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine jo tum ne kiya dekha; mujhe tumhari taraf nikalne se siwa is ke kuch nahi roka ke mujhe darr tha ke tum par farz kar di jayegi."
"3462","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine aaj raat do aadmiyon ko dekha jo mere paas aaye aur mera haath pakar kar mujhe Muqaddas zameen ki taraf le gaye; kiya dekhta hun ke aik aadmi baitha hai aur aik aadmi us ke sar par khara hai jis ke haath mein lohe ka aala hai; wo use us ke jabre mein daalta hai aur use cheer-ta hai yahan tak ke us ki gardan se nikaal deta hai; phir use nikaalta hai aur us ke doosre jabre mein daalta hai aur ye jabra mil jata hai; pas wo us ke saath aisa karta hai; maine kaha: Ye kiya hai? Donon ne kaha: Chalo; main un ke saath chala; kiya dekhta hun ke aik aadmi apni peeth par leta hai aur aik aadmi khara hai jis ke haath mein pathar ya chataan hai; wo us se us ka sar kuchal deta hai to pathar lurhak jata hai; phir jab wo use lene jata hai to us ka sar jaisa tha waisa ho jata hai; to wo us ke saath waisa karta hai; maine kaha: Ye kiya hai? Donon ne kaha: Chalo; main un ke saath chala; kiya dekhta hun ke tandoor ki sakht par bana hua ghar hai jis ka upar tang aur neeche khula hai; us ke neeche aag jalayi jati hai, us mein nange mard aur auratein hain; phir jab aag bharakti hai to wo upar uth-te hain yahan tak ke qareeb hote hain ke nikal jayein; phir jab bujh jati hai to us mein wapas chale jate hain; maine kaha: Ye kiya hai? Donon ne kaha: Chalo; main chala; kiya dekhta hun ke khoon ki neher hai jis mein aik aadmi hai aur neher ke kinare aik aadmi hai jis ke saamne pathar hain; neher wala aadmi aata hai; phir jab nikalne ke qareeb hota hai to us ke munh mein pathar maara jata hai to wo apni jagah wapas chala jata hai; pas wo us ke saath aisa karta hai; maine kaha: Ye kiya hai? Donon ne kaha: Chalo; main un ke saath chala; kiya dekhta hun ke sabz bagh hai aur us mein zabardast darakht hai; aur us ki jar mein aik boodha hai jis ke gird bachche hain; aur us ke qareeb aik aadmi hai jis ke saamne aag hai; wo use sulgata aur jalata hai; to donon mujhe darakht par charha kar le gaye aur mujhe aik ghar mein dakhil kiya, maine us se zyada khubsurat ghar kabhi nahi dekha; kiya dekhta hun ke us mein boodhe aur naujawan mard hain aur us mein auratein aur bachche hain; phir donon mujhe us se nikaal kar le gaye aur mujhe darakht par charha kar aik ghar mein dakhil kiya jo zyada khubsurat aur afzal hai, us mein boodhe aur naujawan hain; maine un donon se kaha: Tum donon ne aaj raat se mujhe ghumaya hai, pas mujhe khabar do jo maine dekha; donon ne kaha: Haan; raha pehla aadmi jo tum ne dekha to wo jhoota aadmi hai jo jhoot bolta hai to us se aafaaq mein uthaya jata hai; pas us ke saath jo tum ne dekha qayamat ke din tak kiya jayega, phir Allah taala us ke saath jo chahe karega. Aur raha wo aadmi jo tum ne apni peeth par leta dekha to wo aadmi hai jise Allah ne Quran diya to wo raat ko us se soya raha aur din ko us mein jo hai us par amal na kiya; pas us ke saath jo tum ne dekha qayamat ke din tak kiya jayega. Aur rahe wo jinhein tum ne tandoor mein dekha to wo zanakaar hain. Aur raha wo jise tum ne neher mein dekha to wo sood khane wala hai. Aur raha boodha jo tum ne darakht ki jar mein dekha to wo Ibrahim alaihissalam hain. Aur rahe bachche jo tum ne dekhe to logon ke bachche hain. Aur raha wo aadmi jo tum ne aag jalate dekha to wo aag ka khazin hai aur yehi wo aag hai. Aur raha wo ghar jis mein tum pehle dakhil hue to aam mominon ka ghar hai. Aur raha doosra ghar to shaheedon ka ghar hai. Aur main Jibreel hun aur ye Mikaeel hain. Phir donon ne mujh se kaha: Apna sar uthao; maine uthaya to kiya dekhta hun ke baadal jaise hai; donon ne mujh se kaha: Aur ye tumhara ghar hai; maine un donon se kaha: Mujhe chhoro ke main apne ghar mein dakhil hun; donon ne kaha: Tumhari umar baqi hai jo tum ne poori nahi ki; agar tum use poori kar lete to apne ghar mein dakhil hote."
"3463","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine farishton ko Hamza bin Abdul Muttalib aur Hanzala bin Raahib ko ghusl dete dekha."
"3464","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine Jibreel ko dekha, un ke chhe sau par hain."
"3465","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine Jaafar bin Abi Talib ko farishta dekha jo do paron se farishton ke saath jannat mein ur rahe hain."
"3466","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine apne Rab azzawajal ko dekha."
"3467","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine aik naujawan aur aik naujawan larki ko dekha to main un par shaitan se be-khauf nahi raha."
"3468","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine insaanon aur jinno ke shaitanon ko Umar se bhaagte dekha."
"3469","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine Amr bin Aamir Khuzaai ko apni aantein aag mein ghaseet-te dekha; aur wo pehla tha jis ne saaniyon ko chhora aur samundari oontni ko aazaad kiya."
"3470","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine Amr bin Luhay bin Qamaa bin Khandaf ko dekha jo Bani Kaab ke bhai hain, jabke wo apni aantein aag mein ghaseet rahe the."
"3471","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine Isa, Musa aur Ibrahim ko dekha; raha Isa to surkh-rang ghungrale khule seene wale hain; aur raha Musa to saanwala bhaari-jism seedhe baalon wale goya Zut ke mardon mein se hain; aur raha Ibrahim to apne saathi ko dekho, yaani apne aap ko."
"3472","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine khwab mein dekha ke main Makka se aisi zameen ki taraf hijrat kar raha hun jis mein khajoorein hain; mera waham Yamama ya Hajar ki taraf gaya; kiya dekhta hun ke wo Madina Yasrib hai. Aur maine apne is khwab mein dekha ke maine talwar hilayi to us ka upar ka hissa toot gaya; kiya dekhta hun ke wo Uhud ke din mominon ko jo nuqsan pahuncha tha; phir maine use doosri baar hilaya to wo pehle se behtar ho gayi; kiya dekhta hun ke wo fatah jo Allah ne di aur mominon ka jama hona tha. Aur maine us mein gaayen dekhein, aur Allah khair hai; kiya dekhta hun ke wo Uhud ke din mominon mein se jamaa't thi; aur khair wo hai jo Allah ne us ke baad khair di aur sachchai ka sawab jo Allah ne Badr ke din ke baad hamein diya."
"3473","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine aik qaum ko dekha jo is samundar ki peeth par sawaar hoti hai takhton par baadshahon jaise."
"3474","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine dekha goya aik kaali bikhre baalon wali aurat Madina se nikli yahan tak ke Mahyaa mein utri; maine is ki taabeer ki ke Madina ki waba us ki taraf muntaqil ho gayi."
"3475","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine dekha goya main aaj raat Uqba bin Raafe ke ghar mein hun aur mere paas Ibn Taab ki khajooron mein se khajoor layi gayi; maine is ki taabeer ki ke hamare liye duniya mein bulandi aur aakhirat mein achcha anjaam hai aur hamara deen paakeeza ho gaya hai."
"3476","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine dekha goya main mazboot zirha mein hun aur gaayen zabah hoti dekhein; maine taabeer ki ke mazboot zirha Madina hai aur gaayen jamaa't hain, aur Allah khair hai."
"3477","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine meraj ki raat Musa ko dekha: saanwala lamba ghungrala aadmi goya Shanoo'a ke mardon mein se hain; aur Isa ko dekha: darmiyane qad surkhi aur safaidi ki taraf mael seedhe sar wale aadmi; aur Maalik aag ke khazin aur Dajjal ko dekha."
"3478","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine khud ko jannat mein dakhil hote dekha; kiya dekhta hun ke Rumaisa Abu Talha ki biwi hain; aur maine apne saamne se khash-khashahat suni; maine kaha: Ae Jibreel, ye kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Ye Bilal hain. Aur maine safaid mahal dekha jis ke sehan mein laundi thi; maine kaha: Ye mahal kis ka hai? Unhon ne kaha: Umar bin Khattab ka hai; maine chaha ke us mein dakhil hun aur use dekhun; phir mujhe tumhari ghairat yaad aayi."
"3479","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maheene ka ribat zamane bhar ke roze se behtar hai; aur jo Allah ke raaste mein murabit mar jaye wo bare ghabrahat se mehfooz rahega; subah-shaam us ka rizq us par laya jayega, jannat se hawa payega aur us par murabit ka ajr jaari rahega yahan tak ke Allah use uthaye."
"3480","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Din ka ribat maheene ke roze aur qayam se behtar hai."
"3481","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ke raaste mein din ka ribat maheene ke roze aur qayam se afzal hai; aur jo us mein mar jaye wo qabr ki aazmaish se bacha liya jayega aur us ka amal qayamat ke din tak us ke liye barhta rahega."
"3482","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ke raaste mein din ka ribat duniya aur jo us mein hai us se behtar hai; aur tum mein se kisi ke kore ki jagah jannat mein duniya aur jo us mein hai us se behtar hai; aur wo shaam ya subah jo banda Allah ke raaste mein guzare duniya aur jo us mein hai us se behtar hai."
"3483","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Din-raat ka ribat maheene ke roze aur qayam se behtar hai; aur agar murabit mar jaye to us ka amal jo wo karta tha us par jaari rahega, us ka rizq us par jaari kiya jayega aur wo aazmane wale se mehfooz rahega."
"3484","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kitne pur-ghubaar darwazon se dhutkare hue hain ke agar Allah par qasam khayein to wo use poora kare."
"3485","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae mere Rab, meri madad farma aur mere khilaf madad na farma; mujhe nusrat de aur mere khilaf nusrat na de; mere liye tadbeer farma aur mere khilaf tadbeer na farma; mujhe hidayat de aur mere liye hidayat aasaan farma; aur jo mujh par ziyadti kare us ke khilaf meri madad farma. Ae Allah, mujhe apna shukr karne wala, apna zikr karne wala, apna darr rakhne wala, apna farmabardar, apne huzoor jhukne wala, aah karne wala, rujoo karne wala bana; ae mere Rab, meri tauba qubool farma, mera bojh dho de, meri dua qubool farma, meri daleel mazboot farma, mere dil ko hidayat de, meri zaban seedhi farma, aur mere dil ki jalan nikaal de."
"3486","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae mere Rab, mujhe bakhsh de aur meri tauba qubool farma; beshak tu bahut tauba qubool karne wala bakhshne wala hai."
"3487","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kitne do purane kapron wale hain jin ki parwah nahi ki jati ke agar Allah par qasam khayein to wo use poora kare."
"3488","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kitne rozedar hain jin ke roze mein bhook ke siwa kuch nahi; aur kitne qayam karne wale hain jin ke qayam mein jaagne ke siwa kuch nahi."
"3489","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kitne jhuke hue khajoor ke khoshe Ibn Dahdaha ke liye jannat mein hain."
"3490","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kitne qayam karne wale hain jin ka qayam mein hissa jaagna hai; aur kitne rozedar hain jin ka roze mein hissa bhook aur pyaas hai."
"3491","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah mere bhai Yusuf par rehem kare; agar qaid ki lambi muddat ke baad qasid mere paas aata to main jawab mein jaldi karta jab unhon ne kaha: Apne Rab ke paas wapas jao aur us se pucho ke aurton ka kiya haal hai."
"3492","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah us aadmi par rehem kare jo bola to faida uthaya ya khamosh raha to mehfooz raha."
"3493","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah us aadmi par rehem kare jo Asr se pehle chaar rakaatein parhe."
"3494","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah us aadmi par rehem kare jo raat ko uth kar namaz parhe aur apni biwi ko jagaye to wo namaz parhe; phir agar wo inkar kare to us ke chehre par paani chhirke. Aur Allah us aurat par rehem kare jo raat ko uth kar namaz parhe aur apne shohar ko jagaye to wo namaz parhe; phir agar wo inkar kare to us ke chehre par paani chhirke."
"3495","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah us bande par rehem kare jo narm ho jab beche, narm ho jab khareede, narm ho jab ada kare, narm ho jab taqaza kare."
"3496","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah us bande par rehem kare jo khair kahe to faida uthaye ya burayi se khamosh rahe to mehfooz rahe."
"3497","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah us bande par rehem kare jo bola to faida uthaya ya khamosh raha to mehfooz raha."
"3498","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah falan par rehem kare; us ne mujhe falan falan aayatein yaad dilaein jo main falan falan surat mein se chhor gaya tha."
"3499","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah Loot par rehem kare; wo mazboot sahare ki panah lete the; aur Allah ne un ke baad koi Nabi nahi bheja magar wo apni qaum mein dolatmand tha."
"3500","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah Musa par rehem kare; unhein is se zyada takleef di gayi to unhon ne sabr kiya."
"3501","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki rehmat ham par aur Musa par ho; agar wo sabr karte to apne saathi se ajeeb cheezein dekhte."
"3502","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mangne wale ko lautao chahe jala hua khur de kar."
"3503","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maqtooleen ko un ke bistaron ki taraf lautao."
"3504","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ka aadmi ki taraf qasid us ki ijazat hai."
"3505","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni safon ko mila kar rakho, un ke darmiyan faasla kam karo aur gardanein barabar rakho; qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, main shaitanon ko safon ki khaali jagahon mein dakhil hote dekhta hun goya wo chhote pathar hain."
"3506","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Rab ki raza walid ki raza mein hai aur Rab ka ghussa walid ke ghusse mein hai."
"3507","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Rab ki raza waldain ki raza mein hai aur us ka ghussa un ke ghusse mein hai."
"3508","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ki raza us ki khamoshi hai, yaani kunwari ki."
"3509","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main apni ummat ke liye us par raazi hua jis par Ibn Umm Abd raazi hue."
"3510","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us aadmi ki naak khaak-aalood ho jis ke saamne mera zikr kiya jaye aur wo mujh par durood na bheje; aur us aadmi ki naak khaak-aalood ho jis par Ramazan aaye phir guzar jaye is se pehle ke use bakhsh diya jaye; aur us aadmi ki naak khaak-aalood ho jis ke paas us ke waldain burhape ko pahunchein aur wo use jannat mein dakhil na karein."
"3511","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ki naak khaak-aalood ho, phir khaak-aalood ho, phir khaak-aalood ho: jo apne waldain ko burhape mein paye, un mein se aik ya donon, phir jannat mein dakhil na ho."
"3512","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qalam teen se uthaya gaya hai: deewane se jo apni aql par maghloob hai yahan tak ke sehat-yaab ho; aur sone wale se yahan tak ke jaag jaye; aur bachche se yahan tak ke baaligh ho."
"3513","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qalam teen se uthaya gaya hai: sone wale se yahan tak ke jaag jaye; aur aazmaish-zada se yahan tak ke sehat-yaab ho; aur bachche se yahan tak ke bara ho."
"3514","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qalam teen se uthaya gaya hai: sone wale se yahan tak ke jaag jaye; bachche se yahan tak ke jawan ho; aur be-waquf se yahan tak ke aqlmand ho."
"3515","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat se khata, bhool aur jo un se zabardasti karaya jaye utha liya gaya hai."
"3516","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe Sidrat-ul-Muntaha tak buland kiya gaya jis ki inteha saatwein aasmaan mein hai; us ke ber Hajar ke matkon jaise hain aur us ke patte haathiyon ke kaanon jaise hain; kiya dekhta hun ke chaar neherein hain, do zahir aur do andar; rahi zahir donon: to Neel aur Furaat hain; aur rahi andar donon: to jannat mein do neherein hain. Aur mere paas teen piyale laye gaye: aik piyale mein doodh tha, aik mein shehad tha aur aik mein sharaab thi; maine wo liya jis mein doodh tha aur piya; to mujh se kaha gaya: Tum ne fitrat ko pa liya, tum ne aur tumhari ummat ne."
"3517","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Fajr ki do rakaatein duniya aur jo us mein hai us se behtar hain."
"3518","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do halki rakaatein jinhein tum haqeer aur kam samajhte ho, ye unhein apne amal mein barha le, ye use tumhari baqi duniya se zyada mehboob hain."
"3519","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ramazan mubarak maheena hai: us mein jannat ke darwaze khole jate hain, dozakh ke darwaze band kiye jate hain, shaitan jakar diye jate hain; aur pukarne wala har raat pukarta hai: Ae khair ke talabgar, aage barh; aur ae shar ke talabgar, ruk ja."
"3520","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teer-andazi karo ae Bani Ismail; kyunke tumhare baap teer-andaz the."
"3521","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Juma ke liye jana har baaligh par wajib hai."
"3522","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Rehem karne walon par Rahman tabarak wa taala rehem karta hai: zameen walon par rehem karo, aasmaan wala tum par rehem karega."
"3523","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sawaar janaze ke peeche ho aur paidal jahan chahe us se ho; aur bachche par namaz-e-janaza parhi jayegi."
"3524","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aik sawaar shaitan hai, do sawaar do shaitan hain, aur teen sawaron ki jamaa't hai."
"3525","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sawaar janaze ke peeche chale aur paidal us ke peeche, aage, dayein aur bayein us ke qareeb chale; aur giraye hue par namaz-e-janaza parhi jayegi aur us ke waldain ke liye maghfirat aur rehmat ki dua ki jayegi."
"3526","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Naik aadmi ka achcha khwab nabuwat ke chhiyalees hisson mein se aik hissa hai."
"3527","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Achcha khwab hi khushkhabri hai jise momin dekhta hai ya us ke liye dekha jata hai."
"3528","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Naik khwab nabuwat ke pachees hisson mein se aik hissa hai."
"3529","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Naik khwab nabuwat ke sattar hisson mein se aik hissa hai."
"3530","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Naik khwab nabuwat ke chhiyalees hisson mein se aik hissa hai."
"3531","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Naik khwab Allah ki taraf se hai aur bura khwab shaitan ki taraf se; pas jab tum mein se koi napasand cheez dekhe to jaagte hi apne bayein teen baar thuthkare aur Allah se us ke shar se panah mange; kyunke wo use nuqsan nahi pahuncha sakta."
"3532","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Naik khwab Allah ki taraf se hai aur bura khwab shaitan ki taraf se; pas jo khwab dekhe aur us mein se kisi cheez ko napasand kare to apne bayein thuthkare aur Allah se shaitan se panah mange; kyunke wo use nuqsan nahi pahuncha sakta aur use kisi ko na bataye; phir agar achcha khwab dekhe to khushkhabri de aur use siwa dost ke kisi ko na bataye."
"3533","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khwab teen hain: Allah ki taraf se khushkhabri, nafs ki baat aur shaitan ki taraf se darana; pas jab tum mein se koi pasandeeda khwab dekhe to agar chahe kisi ko suna de; aur agar napasand cheez dekhe to kisi ko na sunaye, khara ho aur namaz parhe. Aur main tok ko napasand karta hun aur zanjeer ko pasand karta hun; zanjeer deen mein mazbooti hai."
"3534","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khwab teen hain: un mein shaitan ki taraf se daraoni cheezein hain taake ibn Adam ko ghamgeen kare; un mein wo jo aadmi jaagte mein sochta hai aur use khwab mein dekhta hai; aur un mein nabuwat ke chhiyalees hisson mein se aik hissa hai."
"3535","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khwab parinde ke pair par hai jab tak us ki taabeer na ki jaye; phir jab taabeer ki jaye to waaqe ho jata hai; aur use siwa dost ya raay wale ke kisi ko na sunao."
"3536","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khwab Allah ki taraf se hai aur bura khwab shaitan ki taraf se; pas jab tum mein se koi napasand cheez dekhe to apne bayein teen baar thuke, teen baar shaitan-e-rajeem se Allah ki panah mange aur jis pehlu par tha us se palat jaye."
"3537","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sood ke bahattar darwaze hain; un mein sab se kam aisa hai jaise aadmi apni maa se zina kare; aur sood mein sab se bara apne bhai ki izzat mein daraazi karna hai."
"3538","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sood ke tihattar darwaze hain."
"3539","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sood ke tihattar darwaze hain; un mein sab se aasaan aisa hai jaise aadmi apni maa se nikah kare; aur sood mein sab se bara musalman aadmi ki izzat hai."
"3540","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sood ke sattar darwaze hain aur shirk isi jaise hai."
"3541","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sood ke sattar gunah hain; un mein sab se aasaan ye hai ke aadmi apni maa se nikah kare."
"3542","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sood chahe kitna barh jaye, us ka anjaam kami ki taraf hota hai."
"3543","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi apni sawari ke agle hisse ka zyada haqdar hai aur apni majlis ka zyada haqdar hai jab wapas aaye."
"3544","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi apni majlis ka zyada haqdar hai; aur agar apni haajat ke liye nikle phir wapas aaye to wo apni majlis ka zyada haqdar hai."
"3545","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi apne dost ke deen par hota hai; pas tum mein se har aik dekhe ke wo kis se dosti karta hai."
"3546","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sangsaari jo tum ne kiya us ka kaffara hai."
"3547","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Rehem Arsh se latki hui reshmi dor hai."
"3548","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Rehem Rahman se nikli hui reshmi dor hai; Allah ne farmaya: Jo tumhein jore main use jorunga aur jo tumhein kaate main use katunga."
"3549","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Rehem Arsh se latki hui hai, kehti hai: Jo mujhe jore Allah use jorega aur jo mujhe kaate Allah use kaatega."
"3550","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Rehmat Allah ke paas sau hisse hai; us ne makhlooq ke darmiyan aik hissa taqseem kiya aur ninyanwe qayamat ke din tak mo'akhkhar kiye."
"3551","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Rizq bande ko us ki maut se zyada shadeed talab karta hai."
"3552","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Doodh ka rishta usay haraam karta hai jisay paidaish haraam karti hai."
"3553","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Baadal-garaj Allah ke farishton mein se aik farishta hai jo baadal par muakkal hai; us ke saath aag ke kode hain jin se wo baadal ko hankta hai jahan Allah chahe."
"3554","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ruqba jaiz hai."
"3555","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Raqoob wo aurat hai jis ka koi beta na mare."
"3556","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Raqoob wo hai jis ka aage bheja hua na ho."
"3557","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Poora Raqoob wo hai jis ki aulaad ho phir mar jaye aur wo un mein se kuch aage na bheje."
"3558","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo sawaar jin ke saath ghanti ho, farishte un ka saath nahi karte."
"3559","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Rukn aur Maqam jannat ke yaqooton mein se do yaqoot hain."
"3560","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ke raaste mein shaam ya subah jana duniya aur jo us mein hai us se behtar hai."
"3561","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Girwi sawari aur doodh ke liye hai."
"3562","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Girwi par sawari us ke kharch ke ewaz ki jayegi aur doodh wali ka doodh piya jayega jab wo girwi ho."
"3563","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hawa aik qaum ke liye azab aur doosron ke liye rehmat bankar bheji jati hai."
"3564","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hawa Allah ki saans mein se hai: rehmat lekar aati hai aur azab lekar aati hai; pas jab tum use dekho to use bura na kaho; Allah se us ki khair mango aur Allah se us ke shar se panah mango."
